id: DRAFT-lftp-4.9.3-automake-timeout-124-trs-fallback-install-sh-override
trigger_tool: make|conan
phase: testing|packaging
error_signature: ftp-list\.log\] Error 124|install-sh not found|install-man1.*Error 64
severity: 3
category: autotools, testing, build-system, network, ohos
match_keywords: automake_timeout_124_trs_fallback, install_sh_override_toybox, hmbs_repair_method, TESTS_ENVIRONMENT, make check -k, .trs
title: Automake联网阻塞测试超时124转FAIL保.trs落盘与动态定位install-sh覆盖残缺系统install
root_cause: Automake并行harness对timeout kill的exit 124不写.trs致回退漏计，缺-k首FAIL即停无test-suite.log汇总；ftp-cls-l/ftp-list/http-get直连mirror.yandex.ru等公网无超时离线hang至Signal 9；OHOS toybox install缺-c致man页install-man1 Error 64且install-sh仅顶层查找未命中实际位置
affected_scope: 含直连公网阻塞式测试的Automake包需超时限时保汇总者；源码含install-sh而系统install残缺的autotools包；可复用于同类Automake联网阻塞包
verification_cmd: 真机make check -j1 -k日志含Error 124转FAIL且tests/*.trs落盘，test-suite.log或.trs回退按:test-result:计数并诚实记录gaps继续打包；make install无Error 64且INSTALL已覆盖为源码install-sh
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: timeout-124-to-fail-with-trs-fallback-keep-going-and-install-sh-override
rec_description: 超时包装脚本将124转为普通FAIL保.trs落盘，-k跑完7项后优先test-suite.log无汇总时回退解析tests/*.trs的:test-result:行诚实记gaps继续打包；_find_install_sh多候选加浅层递归定位后以INSTALL覆盖残缺系统install
rec_command: conanfile.py新增sh调用超时包装经TESTS_ENVIRONMENT挂载timeout 60转124为exit 1；make check改为-j1 -k；无汇总时解析tests/*.trs；_find_install_sh多候选查找后configure期export INSTALL与make install时INSTALL覆盖
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: honest-gap-record-without-wrapper-or-man-skip
fallback_description: 若无timeout或install-sh缺失不可覆盖，保持原行为不硬失败，仅按已落盘.trs部分计数并诚实记录未跑项environment gaps后继续打包，保留失败审计
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: ftp-list\.log\] Error 124|install -c -m 644
forbid_1_reason: 禁止保留裸timeout致124无.trs或仍用系统toybox install -c硬装；必须124转FAIL保.trs并以源码install-sh覆盖INSTALL
forbid_1_consequence: 汇总缺失记账失配或install-man1 Error 64重现，真机预检evidence incomplete退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-buildtorrent-umask-mktemp, DRAFT-darts-getcwd-shell, DRAFT-ndpi-header-install]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-lftp-4.9.3-automake-timeout-124-trs-fallback-install-sh-override.md
last_updated: 2026-09-27
source_event: lftp/4.9.3真机预检make check超时124无.trs与man安装Error 64并修复为转FAIL落盘与install-sh覆盖
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 13393
